# Files excluded from the container build context. containers/Dockerfile does
# `COPY . .` over the repo root, so host-only artifacts must be kept out of
# the image. Most important: a host `build/` dir carries a CMakeCache.txt with
# absolute host paths, which breaks the in-image `cmake` configure. Honored by
# both podman (.containerignore falls back to this) and docker.
build*/
sbom/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
.cache/
*.log
frames*.jsonl
.git/
.ffprofile-tmp/
*.png
